+            "q8_0 KV, /no_think, n_predict>=2048, and never targeted the 3090s."
+        ),
+        (
+            "OPERATOR-CHECK: Verify frozen stack peak VRAM "
+            f"{peak_vram_gb:.3f}GB is below the ~16GB Kaggle budget."
+        ),
+        (
